1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,466
Finally the Moebius process refines it electrolytically, with silver nitrate as the electrolyte, to ninety nine point nine percent.

2
00:00:09,466 --> 00:00:10,807
Why cyanide at all?

3
00:00:10,807 --> 00:00:20,507
Silver ions form an extremely stable complex with cyanide, so stable that even the insoluble sulphide is forced into solution.

4
00:00:20,507 --> 00:00:22,942
The price is a lethal effluent.

